WEBVTT

00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:07,680
And everybody, this is Dr. Kevin Conner's and welcome to our modules, the Stomp Fighting Cancer

00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:08,840
series.

00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:14,000
This course is going to be, we created it really to help people that may never be able

00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,160
to come to our clinic or maybe don't need to come to our clinic.

00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:22,400
They just need a little extra hand holding, a little extra guidance.

00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:27,240
It's meant to try to break down my book into pieces that are maybe more usable.

00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:28,560
It's a long book.

00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,680
I know there's a lot of information.

00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:36,640
And sometimes when you get a grave diagnosis like cancer, it seems to like you're drinking

00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,640
from a fire hose.

00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:42,280
Sometimes it's hard to get that information and really distill it down to what you need.

00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:45,240
So we tried to simplify it through these modules.

00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:51,680
We're going to have some different protocols that you can use as you can, help guide you

00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:54,760
through your process a little bit better.

00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:59,480
So a little bit about me, why I got into cancer.

00:00:59,480 --> 00:01:01,120
It was never my desire.

00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:05,120
So I got into cancer because I really was led into cancer.

00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:11,120
This is really my calling.

00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:17,480
I was really graduated as a chiropractor and really as a functional doctor, functional medical

00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:23,040
doctor kind of thing at that time though we didn't use that terminology.

00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:29,360
But the process that God took me through, I was always intrigued with the right even while

00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:37,280
I was in school, the right machine, the technology that we use primarily for cancer patients.

00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:44,200
And I was always big into nutrition dietary things since actually since I was younger.

00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:50,480
My mom really have to give her the credit for leading us and our family down that way before

00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:51,560
it was even cool.

00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:56,240
She was into nutrition and diet and eating well.

00:01:56,240 --> 00:02:02,760
So, but while I was in school, I got intrigued with this right machine, a royal right.

00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:09,400
And I don't, I know why now, but I didn't know why then when I graduated, I always thought

00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,920
someday I want to have a right machine.

00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:16,760
And it wasn't until years later in the 90s, I graduated in the 80s, in the 90s, one of

00:02:16,760 --> 00:02:21,440
my patients came to me and she had breast cancer in both breasts and they gave her three

00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:29,680
months to live if she didn't do chemo and radiation and she refused it for her personal reasons.

00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:36,000
And that was like my aha moment, time to buy this right machine that I had been looking at.

00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:41,120
And she lived another 13 years with the use of the right, with use of nutrition, with

00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:43,760
what I knew at that time.

00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:49,720
Slowly God sent me another patient, another cancer patient and I started to really see what

00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:54,200
his calling was for me is to help cancer patients.

00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:58,800
And even in my own journey, you could read about my personal journey with cancer as well

00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:04,360
on our website where I had some very dark days where I didn't know if I was going to make

00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,360
it.

00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:07,240
And I'm not guaranteed tomorrow.

00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:11,920
So maybe you're watching this video and I'm not even here anymore, but God is with us

00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,800
through all these things.

00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:17,480
I really believe that and I believe he has a purpose.

00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:23,440
And in our gravest consequences that we're dealing with in life, even in your cancer,

00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:30,000
he has a purpose and it's to bring him glory and ultimately to glorify you through it in

00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,000
the end.

00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:33,520
So I trust him in that.

00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:40,280
I know that he's led me down this pathway that I feel like it's our real, as a clinic,

00:03:40,280 --> 00:03:45,480
it's our responsibility to give as much information as we possibly can to help people.

00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:51,560
We want to help you and I want these modules to be a blessing to you.

00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:58,880
Please come back to this site over and over again, I'm going to be constantly adding more

00:03:58,880 --> 00:03:59,880
information.

00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:01,320
We're going to be adding different protocols.

00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:04,680
We're going to be adding different tools that you could use.

00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:08,640
So as you get through these seven modules, it's only going to take you a couple hours, but

00:04:08,640 --> 00:04:09,640
come back.

00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:14,280
We're going to be adding more and more stuff that's going to be a benefit to you and you

00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:16,200
have access to it.

00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:19,120
So utilize these services.

00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:24,000
So as God gives me information and put something on my heart to share with you, I'm going to

00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:28,320
make a video, I'm going to put it in writing, we're going to put it together.

00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:35,640
Please also download all my books, there are all a free download, utilize those.

00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:39,920
We just want you to feel like you're being serviced and you're being cared for and that

00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:43,920
you're being loved and you're certainly being prayed for.

00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:47,080
So that's the most important thing.

00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:52,840
So I hope this is a blessing to you and we'll see you at the end of these modules and throughout

00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:53,840
this whole time.

00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:54,840
And throughout your whole journey.

00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:55,840
Thanks so much.

00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:56,840
Bye.

